&lt;h5&gt;STEP 2: Choose the Rundll32 stager from the framework&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;step-2-choose-the-rundll32-stager-from-the-framework&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
