&lt;h5&gt;STEP 3: Call the malicious java script produced by the koadic framework from the victims device.&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;step-3-call-the-malicious-java-script-produced-by-the-koadic-framework-from-the-victims-device&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
