&lt;h5&gt;STEP 4: Interact with the infected host from the console&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;step-4-interact-with-the-infected-host-from-the-console&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
