&lt;h5&gt;STEP 2: Copy the command produced by metasploit and run it in the victims device.&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;step-2-copy-the-command-produced-by-metasploit-and-run-it-in-the-victims-device&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
